sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Agent
  participant Continuity as current-task.json
  participant Locks as File Locks
  participant GitHub as PR/Issues
  participant Evidence
  Agent->>Continuity: read current project state
  Agent->>GitHub: inspect active PR/issues
  Agent->>Locks: request file/work-order lock
  alt lock granted
    Agent->>Agent: execute bounded work
    Agent->>Evidence: write command/diff/test evidence
    Agent->>Continuity: patch status, branch, PR, blockers, next action
    Agent->>Locks: release or extend lock
  else lock conflict
    Agent->>Continuity: record blocked/parallel conflict
    Agent->>GitHub: update issue if human decision needed
  end
